  "design_manifesto": "The slide presents a modern, educational atmosphere with a focus on clarity and structured information. The background is solid white, providing a clean canvas that highlights the content. Decorative motifs include a blue header bar with a vertical line, adding a touch of color and guiding the viewer's eye. Typography is straightforward, featuring bold titles and lighter body text, creating a hierarchy that aids in comprehension. Effects are minimal, with no shadows or rounded corners, maintaining a professional and unobtrusive look. The layout is airy, with ample whitespace ensuring that content is not overcrowded, allowing for easy reading and focus on key elements.",
